open question "Sender authorisation - exact rules for who is an authorised sender in non-trusted, non-main groups?"
open question "Trigger matching - should trigger_pattern apply to sender name, message content, or both?"
open question "Attachment persistence - attachment metadata (filename, mime type, local path) is not currently stored in the messages table. Until it is, media label enrichment ('[Image: …]', '[Audio: …]' etc.) cannot be regenerated from stored fields, violating the intent of MessageEnrichmentRegenerableFromStoredFields for messages with attachments. Should an attachments table or JSON column be added?"
